Package: infera-studio
Version: 1.3.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Infera Studio Project <maintainers@infera-studio.invalid>
Replaces: cortex-local
Conflicts: cortex-local
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), libasound2t64, libatk-bridge2.0-0t64, libatk1.0-0t64, libcups2t64, libgbm1, libgcc-s1, libglib2.0-0t64, libgtk-3-0t64, libnss3, libstdc++6, libxss1, libxtst6, xdg-utils
Description: Infera Studio desktop chat for local llama.cpp models
 Infera Studio discovers GGUF models, manages a private llama.cpp server, and
 provides streaming chat, offline dictation, local project file tools, and live inference monitoring.
 An existing compatible llama-server executable and local GGUF are required
 for inference.
